  "scope": "Source112 over the current native creature table: freeze initial base speeds after source initialization, exclude source machines/commanders/dummies from the maximum, apply max-old+3 once, preserve later canonical MA writes and separate terrain/hero/rank bonuses. Six numeric MA fields are queried and edited through their map-local overlays.",
